Package: omc
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Drake Stapleton <drake@aienos.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/aien-dev/omega-mv
Description: Omega compiler, born from a 408-byte hand-written seed
 omc compiles Omega (.om) source read on stdin into a static AArch64 Linux
 ELF written to stdout. This build was produced by aien-dev/omega-mv
 seed/omega-from-seed.sh at commit @COMMIT@: seed0 (408 bytes of
 hand-written hex) -> hex1 -> asm2 -> om4 -> omc -> omc -> omc, with no C
 compiler, assembler or linker in the chain. The installed binary's sha256
 was checked against the pinned value @OMC_SHA256@.
 .
 arm64 (AArch64 Linux) only. omc emits AArch64 Linux code only.
